ign-items:center;\"><span class=\"up\">✓</span> Basic analytics</li>\n        <li class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"align-items:center;color:var(--muted, #999);\"><span>✗</span> <s>Custom domains</s></li>\n        <li class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"align-items:center;color:var(--muted, #999);\"><span>✗</span> <s>Advanced integrations</s></li>\n      </ul>\n      <div style=\"margin-top:1rem;\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-outline btn-block\">Get started free</button>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"small muted\" style=\"text-align:center;\">No credit card required</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Pro -->\n    <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\" style=\"position:relative;border:2px solid var(--accent, #6366f1);\">\n      <span class=\"badge\" style=\"position:absolute;top:-0.7rem;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:var(--accent,#6366f1);color:#fff;\">Most popular</span>\n      <div>\n        <h3>Pro</h3>\n        <p class=\"muted small\">For professionals who need more power.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row\" style=\"align-items:baseline;gap:0.25rem;\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:2.4rem;font-weight:700;\">$19</span>\n        <span class=\"muted small\">/ month</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"small up\">Billed annually — save 20%</p>\n      <hr />\n      <ul style=\"list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;\" class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <li class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"align-items:center;\"><span class=\"up\">✓</span> Unlimited projects</li>\n        <li class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"align-items:center;\"><span class=\"up\">✓</span> 100 GB storage</li>\n        <li class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"align-items:center;\"><span class=\"up\">✓</span> Priority email support</li>\n        <li class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"align-items:center;\"><span class=\"up\">✓</span> Advanced analytics</li>\n        <li class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"align-items:center;\"><span class=\"up\">✓</span> Custom domains</li>\n        <li class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"align-items:center;\"><span class=\"up\">✓</span> 10+ integrations</li>\n        <li class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"align-items:center;\"><span class=\"up\">✓</span> API access</li>\n      </ul>\n      <div style=\"margin-top:1rem;\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-block\">Start 14-day trial</button>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"small muted\" style=\"text-align:center;\">Free trial · cancel anytime</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Team -->\n    <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n      <div>\n        <h3>Team</h3>\n        <p class=\"muted small\">For teams that need collaboration and control.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row\" style=\"align-items:baseline;gap:0.25rem;\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:2.4rem;font-weight:700;\">$49</span>\n        <span class=\"muted small\">/ month</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"small muted\">Per seat, billed annually</p>\n      <hr />\n      <ul style=\"list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;\" class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <li class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"align-items:center;\"><span class=\"up\">✓</span> Everything in Pro</li>\n        <li class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"align-items:center;\"><span class=\"up\">✓</span> Unlimited storage</li>\n        <li class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"align-items:center;\"><span class=\"up\">✓</span> Dedicated account manager</li>\n        <li class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"align-items:center;\"><span class=\"up\">✓</span> Real-time collaboration</li>\n        <li class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"align-items:center;\"><span class=\"up\">✓</span> SSO &amp; role-based access</li>\n        <li class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"align-items:center;\"><span class=\"up\">✓</span> Audit logs &amp; compliance</li>\n        <li class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"align-items:center;\"><span class=\"up\">✓</span> Custom SLA &amp; 99.9% uptime</li>\n      </ul>\n      <div style=\"margin-top:1rem;\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-block\">Contact sales</button>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"small muted\" sty